  m_Name: DOC_1978_ThiepTanGia
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::KhoaHon.Notebook.DocumentData
  id: DOC_1978_ThiepTanGia
  title: "Thi\u1EC7p t\xE2n gia gia \u0111\xECnh Tr\u1EA7n"
  year: 3
  body: "Tr\xE2n tr\u1ECDng k\xEDnh m\u1EDDi qu\xFD kh\xE1ch \u0111\u1EBFn d\u1EF1
    ti\u1EC7c t\xE2n gia c\u1EE7a gia \u0111\xECnh ch\xFAng t\xF4i t\u1EA1i bi\u1EC7t
    th\u1EF1 Thanh V\xE2n.\n\nM\u1EB7t sau, n\xE9t ch\u1EEF run:\n\"N\u1EEDa cu\u1ED1n
    s\u1ED5 n\xF3i r\u1EB1ng ta s\u1EBD c\xF3 t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3. Ch\u1EC9 c\u1EA7n
    m\u1ED9t b\u1EEFa t\u1ED1i.\""
  serif: 1
  flagOnRead: 0
